"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Цени в магазините</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Типичните цени на 85 стоки от голямата потребителска кошница във всички големи вериги, по данни, които търговците подават всеки ден на Комисията за защита на потребителите. Последни данни: 22.11.2026.</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-4 text-[15px]\"><a href=\"/ceni/nadcenki\">Надценки и цени спрямо чужбина</a>: еднакви продукти в България и Австрия, цена на едро срещу цена в магазина.</p><nav aria-label=\"Секции на страницата\" class=\"sticky top-14 lg:top-0 z-30 -mx-4 sm:-mx-6 px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 mb-8 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-rule\"><ul class=\"flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto text-[15px] whitespace-nowrap\"><li><a href=\"#koshnitsa\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Кошницата</a></li><li><a href=\"#veregi\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Вериги</a></li><li><a href=\"#oblasti\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Области</a></li><li><a href=\"#mesta\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Населени места</a></li><li><a href=\"#stoki\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Всички стоки</a></li><li><a href=\"#kak\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Как смятаме</a></li></ul></nav><section id=\"koshnitsa\" class=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-32 lg:scroll-mt-20\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mb-2\">Кошницата</h2><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted mb-5 max-w-3xl\">Сбор от типичните цени на 20 основни стоки (хляб, мляко, сирене, масло, пиле, кайма, яйца, боб, ориз, захар, брашно, олио, банани, ябълки, домати, лук, картофи и др.).</p><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Кошницата сега</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">56,15 €</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">към <!-- -->22.11.2026</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Промяна от <!-- -->05.01.2026</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">+3,6%</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">същите стоки, типични цени</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Обекти с данни</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">1767</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">55<!-- --> търговци</p></div></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mt-6\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-много поскъпнали от <!-- -->05.01.2026</p><ol class=\"text-[15px] space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Зеле, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+34,8%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Извара, насипна, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+31,7%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Телешки шол, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+31,2%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Телешко за готвене, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+26,3%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Домати, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+20,1%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Цигари, кутия</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+18%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Детско пюре (190–250 г)</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+17,1%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Картофи, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-red\">+17%</span></li></ol></div><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-много поевтинели</p><ol class=\"text-[15px] space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Сапун</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-31,2%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Краставици, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-25%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Риба замразена, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-17,9%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Лимони, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-16,5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Шампоан (250–500 мл)</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-16,5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Краве масло (125–250 г)</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-16,2%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Кафе на зърна, 1 кг</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-14,9%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Баница (100–500 г)</span><span class=\"num text-green\">-13%</span></li></ol></div></div></section><section id=\"veregi\" class=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-32 lg:scroll-mt-20\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mb-2\">Кои вериги са по-евтини</h2><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted mb-5 max-w-3xl\">Средно с колко процента типичната цена във веригата е над или под типичната за страната, по стоките, които веригата продава (поне 20 от 85; само търговци с поне 5 обекта). Сравнението е грубо: веригите продават различни марки и разфасовки.</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Големите вериги (20+ обекта)</p><table class=\"w-full text-[15px] num\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left border-b border-rule text-sm text-muted\"><th class=\"py-2 pr-3 font-normal\">Търговец</th><th class=\"text-right px-2 font-normal\">Спрямо страната</th><th class=\"text-right px-2 font-normal\">Обекти</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-3\">KAM<span class=\"block sm:inline sm:ml-2 text-xs text-muted\">63<!-- --> стоки</span></td><td class=\"text-right px-2 font-semibold 