uncate\">Монтана</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Плевен</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Стара Загора</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-4,2%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Бургас</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-4,2%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Пазарджик</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-3,5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Ловеч</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-3,5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Перник</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-3,3%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Хасково</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-2,5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Пловдив</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-2,5%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Благоевград</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-2,1%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py-1.5 break-inside-avoid\"><span class=\"truncate\">Велико Търново</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-green\">-2%</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 border-b border-rule py