риги. Натисни стока за подробности.</p><ul class=\"divide-y divide-rule border-y border-rule\"><li><details><summary class=\"cursor-pointer py-2 grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_auto] gap-3 items-baseline text-[15px]\"><span>Бял хляб (500 г – 1 кг)</span><span class=\"num font-semibold\">1,12 €</span><span class=\"num text-sm w-16 text-right text-red\">+9,8%</span></summary><div class=\"pb-4 text-[15px] grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mb-1\">Обичайно между <!-- -->0,95 €<!-- --> и <!-- -->1,27 €<!-- -->; <!-- -->6010<!-- --> предложения.</p><p class=\"font-semibold\">Най-евтини вериги (типична цена)</p><ol class=\"space-y-0.5\"><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>ФАНТАСТИКО</span><span class=\"num\">0,76 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>ЖИЗЕЛ</span><span class=\"num\">0,85 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>СУПЕРМАРКЕТ ВИРЕЯ</span><span class=\"num\">0,85 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>KAM</span><span class=\"num\">0,86 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Хипермаркет Жанет</span><span class=\"num\">0,89 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Б 2006 ЕООД</span><span class=\"num\">0,89 €</span></li></ol><p class=\"font-semibold mt-2\">Най-скъпи</p><ol class=\"space-y-0.5\"><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>eBag</span><span class=\"num\">1,63 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Валди</span><span class=\"num\">1,50 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>ПАЦОНИ</span><span class=\"num\">1,34 €</span></li></ol></div><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">По области</p><ol class=\"space-y-0.5 columns-2 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2\"><span>Монтана</span><span class=\"num\">0,91 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2\"><span>Видин</span><span class=\"num\">0,92 €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between gap-2\"><span>Стара Загора</span><span class=\"num\">0,94 €</span></li><li class=\"